# Detail screen UI system (MMR)

Read-only **entity detail** flows use **Design 12** from `docs/design/detail-screen-mockups/index.html`:

- Brand **top bar** (back + title; overflow menu only when needed e.g. loan ⋮)
- **Gray** screen background (`MmrBrandColors.ListBackground`)
- **White / tinted cards** and shared typography in the body
- **Sticky footer CTA bar** (`MmrFooterCtaBar`) — primary actions move here; do not duplicate as FAB + footer

**Source of truth:** `MmrDetailScreenScaffold.kt`, `MmrDetailScreenForm.kt`, `MmrFooterCtaBar.kt` (shared with `MmrContentDialog`).

## Shell

- Wrap detail screens in **`MmrDetailScreenScaffold`** — not raw `Scaffold` + `MmrTopAppBar` + hand-rolled footer.
- Pass **`footerPrimaryLabel` / `footerSecondaryLabel` / `footerTextLabel`** for screen actions (e.g. transaction Edit / Duplicate / Delete).
- Use **`topBarActions`** only for overflow menus (loan edit/pause/delete), not for actions that belong in the footer on Design 12.
- Loading / error: use scaffold `isLoading`, `errorMessage`, `onRetry` — do not nest duplicate `MmrLoadingState` outside the scaffold.

## Body primitives (`MmrDetailScreenForm.kt`)

| Use case | Component |
|----------|-----------|
| Title + amount hero | `MmrDetailHeroBlock` |
| Type/Date/Category meta | `MmrDetailMetaCard` + `MmrDetailMetaRow` |
| Loan/recurring summary | `MmrDetailOverviewCard` |
| Section heading | `MmrDetailSectionTitle` |
| Empty / helper under section | `MmrDetailSectionHint` |
| Linked SMS row | `MmrDetailLinkedSmsCard` |
| Schedule / payment row | `MmrDetailListItemCard` |
| Label/value in overview | `MmrDetailKeyValueRow` |
| Progress | `MmrDetailProgressStrip` |
| Status chip | `MmrDetailStatusBadge` |
| Inline action link | `MmrDetailTextLink` |

## Anti-patterns

- Raw `Card` + `MaterialTheme` for new detail sections without matching the kit.
- `SmallFloatingActionButton` for primary detail actions when Design 12 footer is active (loan repayment → footer).
- Top-bar icon rows for actions that the mockup places in the footer (transaction edit/duplicate/delete).

## New detail screen checklist

1. `MmrDetailScreenScaffold` with title and footer CTAs.
2. `LazyColumn` content via scaffold `content { item { … } }` only.
3. Reuse form components above; add to `MmrDetailScreenForm.kt` if a new pattern repeats twice.
4. Add `MmrTestTags` on footer actions when UI-tested.
